WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.850
Here's Claude on Windows.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:05.630
Go to claude.com/download and click Windows.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.610
Open the installer you downloaded.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.300
When it's done, open Claude from the Start menu and sign in;

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.990
the code comes by email.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.510
Click Projects, then New project,

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.190
and call it Inbox.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:20.500
Paste your email helper into 'Set project instructions',

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.824
then start a chat.

